stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> DRAFT: import a document or copyOf
  DRAFT --> DRAFT: updateDraft (If-Match)
  DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL: requestPublish, zero validation errors
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> DRAFT: reject with reason (requester may withdraw)
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> PUBLISHED: approve by another identity
  PUBLISHED --> RETIRED: superseded (system, exactly once) or retire with reason
  RETIRED --> [*]
  classDef client fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0,color:#16231F
  classDef engine fill:#E0F2F1,stroke:#00796B,stroke-width:2px,color:#16231F
  classDef obs fill:#ECEFF1,stroke:#546E7A,color:#16231F
  class DRAFT,PENDING_APPROVAL client
  class PUBLISHED engine
  class RETIRED obs
